      "source": [
        "# Case Study: Understanding and Implementing K-Means, Hierarchical, and DBSCAN Algorithms\n",
        "\n",
        "**Dataset:** East-West Airlines customer data  \n",
        "**Objective:** Segment airline customers using clustering and compare K-Means, Hierarchical Clustering, and DBSCAN.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Questions this notebook addresses\n",
        "1. What does the dataset look like? Are there missing values or unusual values?\n",
        "2. How can we prepare and scale customer features for clustering?\n",
        "3. What number of clusters is reasonable for K-Means (Elbow method)?\n",
        "4. How do K-Means, Hierarchical Clustering, and DBSCAN group customers?\n",
        "5. What do the clusters tell us about customer flying and reward behaviour?\n",
        "\n",
      ]
    }
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "272b801d",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "272b801d"
      },
      "source": [
