        "id": "fd14426c"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 5. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\n",
        "\n",
        "### 5.1 Distributions of features\n",
        "\n",
        "Histograms help us see whether customer activity is concentrated at low values or spread across a wide range."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 6,
      "id": "e0708acd",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
